<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAL" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Malaki</para>
  <para style="toc1">Malaki</para>
  <para style="toc2">Malaki</para>
  <para style="mt1">Malaki</para>
  <para style="imt">Rik tekah mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih rui miia dow risi Malaki chekhai, now arui khin dow 470-460 BC takra kowi chekhai. Malaki dow Israeluüa tut-e kowh Thurai sang phuang mih risi chekhai. Aia dow Sangbowk Laitawm Prim khin kowi kowh achur nowm nowm mih risi chekhai, now aia dow Sangbowk Laitawm Prim hown Sangbowk Laitawm Sar bowih kowi kowh atawm miia chekhai. Aia kowh satang phuang dow lüntakra hai aklangra hown aia tawngah khai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Risi Malaki krawi tek lai mih khin khe dow Thurai chup kim thawp mih chur khowk chekhai, now ari aiang hai pawi ün plan uowi iawk khowk chekhai. Nachenganchepaw nami kung kowi dow Jihudiuüa pungmadawng kowi lümla pra piakra uang ting khai iawk. Malaki bowih kowi kowh lümla pra kowh akrat pusara lawnguan dow Nehemia bowih kowi paw arui uowi chekhai. Naiawngün dow: Owm dowi miuüa hown tapün talo, pawisa tangka angakma hown sunah mih, hamüt bak kowi pabak Thurai chup kim kowi uang pawla dowi mih, now lümla pra kowh lawnguan kowi süngürra uowi dowi mih ün chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Sangbowk Laitawm Prim kowi achur kowi kowh Thurai kükah mih lawnguan Malaki mih ruiah khai. Malaki kung kowi baptisma pek mih Johan uang ting dowi mowr 400 ning mowr mih mia iawng mih risi paw tek lai dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="iot">Alak kowi kowh uowi mih lawnguan</para>
  <para style="io1">Israeluüa kowi Thurai sakrauah mih 1:1-5</para>
  <para style="io1">Uamowuüa kowi tang pe aprek mih 1:6-2:9</para>
  <para style="io1">Iawngpa mih Jihudiuüa kowi tang pe aprek mih 2:10-4:3</para>
  <para style="io1">Nauowi kaneu kown mih laiklow 4:4-6</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAL 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAL 1:1" />Mami dow Israeluüa vüi kowi kowh Malaki kowi CHAKRAMANG uang tek pe mih laiklow chekhai.<verse eid="MAL 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jakawb kowi sakrauah mih hai Esau kowi nuata mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="MAL 1:2-3" />Aia maru-uüa kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Ang sakrau enni reng,” pakhai. Nachenganchepaw enni tek mih, “Tawng iawng chow en sakrau anging?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAL 1:2-3">Nakhowk khe ang klang enni mih, “Esau mih Jakawb kowh taimow nadowi bow? Nachenganchepaw Jakawb kowi chowtaih ang sakrauah khai. Tawkche Esau kowi dow ang nuata khai. Aia kowh hungma mawngma dow apiaknama ang changta pe khai, now aia kowh süng maten paw süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh brenkhui hawmh kowi ang pe uowiah khai,” pape khai.<verse eid="MAL 1:2-3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAL 1:4" />Esau krungchak Edawmuüa natek kown mih, “Piakta anging khai chepaw anging nakrawi plan rawah iawk kown taih,” napa kown.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAL 1:4">Nachenganchepaw lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Amatni krawi plan raw chepaw ang napiakta pe iawk kown. Amatni kowi dow maru natek pe kown mih, ‘Mami dow türchauma mih pren hai chowngchowng saksakma CHAKRAMANG kunmarauah mih chenchap chekhai,’ napa kown. <verse eid="MAL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAL 1:5" />Naiawng phaw mih dow enni matia mik hown enni nakhi kown, now enni natek kown mih, ‘CHAKRAMANG dow Israel pren sünghi uat kowi paw kri kraingma chekhai,’ napa kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="MAL 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uamowuüa kowi CHAKRAMANG kingküaah mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAL 1:6" />Mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Chauüa dow u-pa kowi ringkawah reng, now nar paw aia kowh kim iah kowi ringkawah reng chekhai. Ang che enni kowh u-pa chekhai hanow tawng kowi chow ang kowh ringkawra? Ang che enni kowh kim iah chekhai hanow tawng kowi chow ang kowh ringkawra? Uamowuüa low, enni dow nü ang klowk ang dowi chekhai. Tawkche enni tek mih, ‘Anging nü en klowk en dowi mih tawng iawng chekhai chow?’ pakhai. <verse eid="MAL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAL 1:7" />Ang kowh phuchuara kowi asürlawkma mih uanap enni uang ap mih enni nü ang klowk ang dowi kowh chekhai. Tawkche enni tek mih, ‘Tawng iawng chow sürlawkma mih phuchua anging uang chang?’ pakhai. CHAKRAMANG kowh pawitang ringkawra kak taing dowi pahai enni tek rakowi enni kowh phuchua dow sürlawkma chekhai. <verse eid="MAL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAL 1:8" />Mik duma mih tawncher hown enni uang chang phuchua mih enni chang ngak mih nadowi bow? Khawk baima mih hai kow ngakma mih tawncher hown enni chang phuchua pawi mih enni chang ngak mih nadowi bow? Enni kowh pren kruitown mih kowi naiawng mih tawncher hown enni chang pe phuchua e nasak-ih enni kown bow? Aia naawmrawm enni kown pe bow? Ang mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG lünta enni mih chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="MAL 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAL 1:9" />Kawmat Thurai tut-e lü lawt e tawng chow mrawkra uowi? Enni kowh rut hown naiawng sürlawkma mih phuchua enni chang mih aia naawmrawm enni kown pe bow? Sünta, mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG tek mih, <verse eid="MAL 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAL 1:10" />“Uh, enni pungmadawng hownia lowk iachow chepaw ang kowh chup kim büng mih uowi khai panü, now phuchuara luk kowi aiawnglowma enni uang towk maih dowi panü ang naawmrawm kown chowdiah. Ang kowh kim büng mih paw uowi dowi, now aiawnglowma enni uang towk maih khai. Naiawng rakowi enni luk kowi mapaw ang sak-ih dowi chekhai, now enni uang phuchuala ang mih uanh paw enni rut hownia ang nahawt paw enni kown nadowi. <verse eid="MAL 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAL 1:11" />Satlawt hownia satkup mowr mih chenchap maten pungmadawng kowi ang kowh ming dow kri kraingma naown kown. Arah maten kowi dow ang vüi nam iungma mih maikhük natowk ang büah kown, now nachangla phuchua kownkow chimsaima mih uanh nauang pawla büah kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang kowh ming dow chenchap maten pungmadawng kowi kri kraingma naown kown.<verse eid="MAL 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAL 1:12" />“Nachenganchepaw enni dow ang kowh ming kowi ringkaw dowi chekhai. Enni tek mih, ‘CHAKRAMANG kowh pawitang dow sürlawkma, now pawitang luk kowi kowh chakkham paw suiiai kaniaima chekhai,’ pakhai. <verse eid="MAL 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAL 1:13" />Nakharela ang kownkow enni plan tek mih, ‘Phuchua chang pusa lai le!’ pakhai. Enni nauang phuchuala ang kownkow enni krawi khünah mih tawncher, khawk baima mih tawncher hai kow ngakma mih tawncher enni uang pawla khai. Naiawng mih tawncher enni uang pawla mih ang nahawt paw enni kown pabow? Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk.<verse eid="MAL 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAL 1:14" />“Kowmatia kowh tawncher hawmh hownia nachangla phuchua kown tataing mih tawncher la uowi khowk, nami klen kowi nami tawncher hown nachangla phuchua kown mih kham paw enni takhamta khowk. Nachenganchepaw asürlawkma mih tawncher hown chowtaih CHAKRAMANG vüi enni chang phuchua khai. Naiawng chang mih maru dow kuanlama chekhai. Aia luk kowi dow piati pauang cham ting lah. Ang chowtaih lang kri lang kraing mih mang, now chenchap maten ang kowi chowtaih nakram ang kown. Ang mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="MAL 1:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAL 2" />
  <para style="s">Uamowuüa kowi Thurai hawiah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAL 2:1" />Lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Aw uamowuüa, mami dow enni nauowi kaneu kown mih laiklow chekhai. <verse eid="MAL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAL 2:2" />Enni che ang laiklow chün dowi, now ang kowh ringkawra prakowi paw pe ching dowi hanow enni luk kowi ang nauang pawla enni piati kown. Enni kaah mih prasira maten kowi ang nape enni piati kown. Nami piati dow kawmat ang peta enni khowk. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nauowi kaneu kownkow ang tek enni mih kowi enni sünta dowi chekhai. <verse eid="MAL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAL 2:3" />Enni rakowi enni kowh krungchakuüa kowi ang naripah kown. Enni changla phuchua pawi mih tawncher kih enni kowh lumowr kowi ang naplik enni kown, now nami kih hailawm alakma kowi ang naprütta enni kown.<verse eid="MAL 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAL 2:4" />“Enni nauowi kaneu kownkow ang tek enni khai. Nami dow Levi krungchakuüa hown ang towta sangbowk laitawm mih naia townla reng kownkow chekhai pami tukah büah reng diah. <verse eid="MAL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAL 2:5" />Leviuüa hown ang tatowah mih sangbowk laitawm dow nasingla kown mih hai naiungla kown mih müa chekhai. Nami sangbowk laitawm dow amatni kowi ang peta khowk chekhai. Ang peah sangbowk laitawm mih dow amatni pacham ringkaw ang lah pakowh chekhai. Amatni dow ringkaw hai kram ang reng chowdiah. <verse eid="MAL 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAL 2:6" />Amatni nawr kowi dow achingma mih tüngsangra uowi reng chowdiah. Nami tüngsangra kowi dow mapaw dai lai uowi dowi chowdiah. Amatni dow anowmma hai thaulangma ang hown taiua mang reng chowdiah, now maru sangrum kowi angak hownia uang pe planah reng chowdiah. <verse eid="MAL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAL 2:7" />Thurai lawnguan kowi kowh tüngsangra natamata dowi kownkow uamowuüa nakrawi tüngsang kown takla chowdiah. Now maru kawmuüa paw Thurai laiklow natukla kownkow uamowuüa tut-e kowkowi takla chowdiah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow uamowuüa dow mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG kowh satang phowng mih chekhai. <verse eid="MAL 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAL 2:8" />Nachenganchepaw enni dow tiama nowm hownia süt khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi enni kowh tüngsangra hownia angak prakowi maru akawmma mang khowk chekhai. Naiawng hown Levi chenchap hown ang tatowah mih sangbowk laitawm dow enni piakta khai. Mami laiklow dow ang mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG tek khowk. <verse eid="MAL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAL 2:9" />Enni mih ang tiama kowi mang dowi chekhai. Ang tiama kowi enni namang lak dow maru kawmuüa kowi ang kowh ari aiang arisang enni tüngsangah dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi maru maten pur kowi prawng renra hai rensi küakau ang changla enni khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="MAL 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaah sakowm dowi iawng Judauüa uowi mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAL 2:10" />A-i kowh pa lowk iachow taih nadowi bow? Thawp a-i mih Thurai paw lowk iachow taih nadowi bow? Nahanow tawngplawng kowchow lowkkowlowk a-i takuan khai? Tawngplawng kowchow a-i pipu-uüa vüi kowi kowh thawpah mih sangbowk laitawm kowi a-i ringkaw dowi? <verse eid="MAL 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAL 2:11" />Judauüa dow kaah sakowm dowi bowt chekhai. Amatni dow Israel pren hai Jerusalem marow kowi suiiai kaniaima mih lup chang reng khai. Judauüa mih akeng thuraiuüa kowi kowh chup mih masiuüa hawmh hown tachawng hanow chimsaima mih Thurai chup kim kowi sürlawkah khai. <verse eid="MAL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAL 2:12" />Naiawng chang miuüa kowi dow mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG vüi uang pawla phuchua chepaw Jakawb krungchak hownia CHAKRAMANG pacham piakta lah.<verse eid="MAL 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAL 2:13" />Nami klen kowi enni chang lup ngak mih uowi lowk tak. Nami lup ngak dow enni uang kar uang nguk hanow mik tui hown enni uang sik CHAKRAMANG kowh phuchuara mih chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawng enni uang chang mih dow enni uang pawla phuchua mih kowi CHAKRAMANG awmrawm dowi hai pe enni ching dowi rakowi chekhai. <verse eid="MAL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAL 2:14" />Enni tek mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow hawt awmrawm dowi?” pakhai. CHAKRAMANG awmrawm dowi mih auan dow enni tachawng khe aia tawi uowi saksi khowk chepaw masi kaah sakowm dowi iawng enni uowi rakowi chekhai. Enni chawngah mih masi hown enni takham khowk chepaw enni kowh masi kaah sakowm dowi iawng enni uowi khai. <verse eid="MAL 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAL 2:15" />Masi huaiu kowi CHAKRAMANG bawngah mih chowbowt nadowi bow? Buk hai lümla mih aiamat kowh chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatchi hownia dow Thurai kowi ringkaw mih krungchak pe uowiah kownkow pabuk panga sang changah mih chekhai. Naiawng rakowi enni kowh saktuak lawnguan kowi uowiah büah kaneu diah. Enni kowh masi kaah sakowm dowi iawng hang uowi büa diah. <verse eid="MAL 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAL 2:16" />CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai tek mih, “Khua masi mih maru kowi ang sui khai,” pakhai. Nami klen kowi paw lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Tawnguat iawng le masi prawn rawn mih maru kowi ang sui chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawng chang mih dow masiuüa kowi chang nowng mih iawng chekhai. Naiawng rakowi enni kowh saktuak mih kaneuma khetah büa diah. Enni kowh masi kaah sakowm dowi iawng hang uowi büa diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="MAL 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tara chetra ni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAL 2:17" />Enni matia laiklow hown CHAKRAMANG kowi enni towkah kawm khai. Nachenganchepaw enni tek mih, “Tawng iawng chow CHAKRAMANG kowi anging towkah kawm?” pakhai. CHAKRAMANG kowi enni towkah kawm mih dow, “Chang lup ngak miuüa maten dow CHAKRAMANG mik kowi aiungma kangowh, now aia dow amatni luk kowi sak-ih reng,” pahai enni tek mih chekhai. Nami klen kowi enni plan tek mih, “Sow, tara nowm chet mih Thurai tawng kowi chow?” pakhai.<verse eid="MAL 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAL 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAL 3:1" />Mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Sünta, ang kowh satang phowng mih kowi ang uang chin enni khowk; aia dow ang dowi rawn nauang rik kamrüt tiama kown. Nami kung kowi dow enni hawt chawngah reng mih CHAKRAMANG mih mingmang dowi khe aia chup kim kowi nauang kown. Süngürma hown enni hawt chawngah mih satang phowng mih dow CHAKRAMANG hown enni tatowah mih sangbowk laitawm nauang phuang kownkow uang tarü thüm khowk.<verse eid="MAL 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAL 3:2" />“Tawkche CHAKRAMANG uang mih ni khe dow miapaw naia kham kown nadowi, now aia pur kowi miapaw nowng iowng kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow chaingla tai mih maih hai chula uan mih dua iawng naown kown chekhai. <verse eid="MAL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAL 3:3" />Tai kowi achangma nathawpah kownkow chawr tai mih maru iawng aia dow nauang kown. Aia dow Leviuüa kowi nauang chimsaiah kown, now amatni kowi dow kuh hai tai kowi achangma changah iawng aia nachangah kown. Nami kung kowi dow amatni mih anowmma mih saktuak hown CHAKRAMANG vüi nachang phuchua pawi bowt kown. <verse eid="MAL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAL 3:4" />Nakhowk khe dow auown khe kowh iawng Juda prenchakuüa hai Jerusalem marowchakuüa kowh phuchua uanh mih CHAKRAMANG nasak-ih pe bowt kown.<verse eid="MAL 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAL 3:5" />“Nakhowk khe mih nachet tara kownkow enni tut-e ang nauang kown. Nami khin khe maiaklese sarauüa, iang chang miuüa, dai lai saksi thuak miuüa, sukkri kowi miuüa kowi kuan miuüa, mamaimowuüa, saratchowuüa kowi chang nowng miuüa hai prenlang maru-uüa kowi chet pe tara nowm dowi miuüa maten kowi alenma ang nakingküaah kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow kram ang dowi chekhai.<verse eid="MAL 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thurai kowh kakbak pe dowi mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAL 3:6" />“Ang dow CHAKRAMANG, ang dow katpaw taklowi dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi Jakawb krungchakuüa low, kawmat pat paw enni piak dowi tak chekhai. <verse eid="MAL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAL 3:7" />Ang kowh ari aiang maten hownia enni süt mih hai ang kowh ari aiang enni chün dowi mih enni kowh pipu-uüa chowng hownia chowbowt. Nachenganchepaw ang prakowi che enni uang plan hanow ang paw enni prakowi nauang plan iawk kown. Tawkchedow enni tek mih, ‘Tawng iawng chow anging nauang planah kown?’ pakhai. <verse eid="MAL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAL 3:8" />Lusa maru mih Thurai kowi nakuan kown mih taka khai bow? Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow enni kuan ang khai. Enni tek mih, ‘Tawng iawng chow anging kuan en?’ pakhai. Enni kuan ang mih dow hamüt bak kowi pabak nape ang kown mih hai uanpek kowi chekhai. <verse eid="MAL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAL 3:9" />Enni dow ka piati khowk chekhai; tawngplawng kowchow panow enni pachenma kuan ang khai. <verse eid="MAL 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAL 3:10" />Ang kim kowi chakkham naia uowila reng kownkow enni kowh hamüt bak kowi pabak mih uanh maten anungra kowi uang pawla büa diah. Enni che uang pawla hanow ang mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG, mukuang kimplawt maten ang nauow enni kown, now enni lakkeah mih klen kowi achütma ang nape enni prasi kown. Nami lawnguan kowi enni che owm dowi hanow chaing ang büa diah. <verse eid="MAL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAL 3:11" />Enni kowh luprak napiakta enni dowi kownkow krawi piak luprak mih chap hai rawka maten kowi ang nahangah kown. Nami klen kowi enni kowh grep krum kowi kowh grep ruih hownia paw auih naprua kown nadowi. <verse eid="MAL 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAL 3:12" />Nakhowk khe dow chenchapuüa maten mih prasira uowima padow natek enni kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow enni kowh pren dow apiaw apama naown bowt kown. Mami laiklow dow ang mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="MAL 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAL 3:13" />CHAKRAMANG plan tek iawk mih, “Enni dow kingküala ang mih laiklow akhawt akhawtma enni tek ang reng chekhai. Tawkche enni tek mih, ‘Tawng iawng chow kingküala en mih laiklow anging tek en?’ pakhai. <verse eid="MAL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAL 3:14" />Enni tek mih, ‘Chang Thurai lup mih aiawnglowma taih. Aia rirow iawng chang lup mih hai changta angak rakowi tarip kowh kar hai nguk hown mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG pur kowi uowi mih tawngpaw mrawk dowi. <verse eid="MAL 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAL 3:15" />Kawmat hownia dow chang bawri miuüa kowi phai prasira uowima pahai a-i tek pe diah sik. Chang lup ngak miuüa dow iuksown rereng; amatni dow Thurai kowi chaingah chepaw tawngpaw own dowi chekhai,’ pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="MAL 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sanara lawnguan kowi CHAKRAMANG laikham</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAL 3:16" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG kowi ringkawma hown kram miuüa dow lowkkowlowk lang talawp khai. Nami laiklow dow CHAKRAMANG mih pe ching se tawi sünta khai. Now CHAKRAMANG kowi ringkawma hown kram mih hai aia lawnguan kowi abüpma tuak miuüa kowh ming mih aia pur kowi kowh charam tua kowi rui pe khai. <verse eid="MAL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAL 3:17" />Amatni lawnguan kowi mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Tara chetra ni khe amatni dow ang kowh amülüng mih dawngthawnguan nachowng kown; amatni dow ang kowh maru chowtaih nachowng kown. Amatni kowi dow chün lai mih chah kowi u-pa sanaah mih iawng ang nasanaah kown. <verse eid="MAL 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAL 3:18" />Nakhowk khe dow maru iung hai maru ngak, now chang ang lup mih hai chang ang lup dowi mih kowi tawng iawng chow ang nakraah kown mih enni nakhi bowt kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="MAL 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAL 4" />
  <para style="s">Tara chetra ni nauang ting kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAL 4:1" />Mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Sünta, tara chetra ni uang ting kown chowbowt. Nami ni dow taping maih iawng nalün kown. Nami ni khe dow chang bawri miuüa hai chang lup ngak miuüa maten chathang kam iawng nakam kown; aprün khowm padow nata lat kown nadowi. <verse eid="MAL 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAL 4:2" />Nachenganchepaw ringkawma hown kram ang miuüa luk kowi dow tachi tanawmra sat nowi nauang sawt kown, now nami sat nowi hownia dow enni naka kür sar kown. Nakhowk khe dow chia rum hownia lawtta mih chia chah iawng thaulangma hai apiawma enni nauowi bowt kown. <verse eid="MAL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAL 4:3" />Nami ni khe dow enni mih maru ngakuüa kowi khawk hown nanünah kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawng ang chang mih khin khe dow maru ngakuüa mih enni khawkpha kowi kowh dinchow iawng naown kown. Mami laiklow dow ang mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG ang tek khowk.<verse eid="MAL 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAL 4:4" />“Ang kowh nar Mosi kowi kowh ang peah mih rirow laiklow nachün kown mih ka tuakah büa diah. Nami rirow dow Israeluüa maten vüi Sinai hungh kowi kowh ang peah mih chekhai.<verse eid="MAL 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAL 4:5" />“Sünta, CHAKRAMANG kowh nami tara chetra ni akraingma hai kramra uowima mih ni uang ting dowi rawn risi Elija kowi enni tut-e ang nauang rik chin enni kown. <verse eid="MAL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAL 4:6" />Ang uang hanow piati hown ang napiakta enni pren dowi kownkow aia dow pauüa kowh saktuak chauüa pra kowi, now chauüa kowh saktuak pauüa prakowi nauang pe planah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="MAL 4:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAL 4" />
</usx>